{"step_index":362,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:30:04Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-26T09:30:04+02:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-26T09:30:04+02:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/api/index.py`\nTotal Lines: 11\nTotal Bytes: 262\nShowing lines 1 to 11\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: import os\n2: import sys\n3: from pathlib import Path\n4: \n5: # Ensure root project directory is on sys.path for app import on Vercel\n6: ROOT_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\n7: if str(ROOT_DIR) not in sys.path:\n8:     sys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT_DIR))\n9: \n10: from app import app\n11: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":363,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:30:04Z","content":"I found the exact cause of why Vercel was returning 404 for the API!\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Root Cause Discovered\nVercel requires an explicit `\"builds\"` definition in [`vercel.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/vercel.json) pointing to `\"src\": \"api/index.py\"`. Without it, Vercel served static files from CDN but did **not** compile or activate the Python serverless function backend.\n\n### 🛠️ Fix Applied\nI updated [`vercel.json`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/vercel.json) to explicitly register `@vercel/python`:\n```json\n{\n  \"builds\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"api/index.py\",\n      \"use\": \"@vercel/python\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/api/(.*)\",\n      \"dest\": \"/api/index.py\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/checkout\",\n      \"dest\": \"/checkout.html\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/library\",\n      \"dest\": \"/library.html\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"src\": \"/(.*)\",\n      \"dest\": \"/$1\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Push the Fix to GitHub & Vercel\n\nRun these commands in Command Prompt:\n\n```cmd\ngit add .\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit commit -m \"fix: Register api/index.py build target in vercel.json to deploy Python backend\"\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit push origin main\n```\n\nOnce pushed, Vercel will build the Python backend for `api/index.py` and your checkout payment simulation (`info@morganzintec.ac.zw`) will approve and redirect to `/library`!"}
