{"step_index":367,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:33:38Z","thinking":"**Discovering a File**\n\nI've just found a crucial piece in `app.py`, specifically line 269. It appears to define how the landing page is served, utilizing `FileResponse` to handle the `index.html` file located in the `PUBLIC_DIR`. This offers valuable context for how the application's root route is implemented.\n\n\n**Analyzing Route Handling**\n\nI've made a breakthrough. I've confirmed FastAPI is used for `/`, `/checkout`, `/library`, and `/api/*`. It seems *all* requests funnel to `app.py`. Why did Vercel fail? I must revisit the previous errors. The `setuptools` fix and the read-only filesystem issues are now crucial.\n\n\n**Resolving Serverless Function**\n\nI've fixed the read-only issue by wrapping the asset copy in `try...except`. Now, I'm focusing on the \"landing page not found\" error. It seems Vercel's serverless container structure matters! `PUBLIC_DIR` was correct, but the \"public/\" and \"data/\" directories weren't copied unless *included* or *referenced* in a crucial file! Vercel's catch-all rewrite also must be used instead of build.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"{\\n  \\\"rewrites\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/checkout\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/checkout.html\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/library\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/library.html\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/api/:path*\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/api/index.py\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/docs\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/api/index.py\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/redoc\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/api/index.py\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"source\\\": \\\"/openapi.json\\\",\\n      \\\"destination\\\": \\\"/api/index.py\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\"","Description":"\"Clean vercel.json using zero-config rewrites for API and CDN for static frontend pages\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\dell\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\\\vercel.json\"","toolAction":"\"Updating vercel.json for Zero Config rewrites\"","toolSummary":"\"Updating vercel.json for Zero Config rewrites\""}}]}
